            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Yun's",
            "review_text": "Bill K\n20 contributions\n0\nNha Hang Yun's is a delicious blend of several cultures!\nFeb 2019 • Friends\nOur group always ordered a wide array of foods. My favorites were several styles of Kim Che, along with some of the best Korean style BBQ Pork I have ever eaten. The vegetables were fresh and tasty. The seafood and fish dishes were delicious as well. I had to go back a couple of days later for more of the pork and Kim Che! \nThe price is right at this restaurant and a beautiful view of the sea! Thank you!\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 13, 2019",
